# BGG stability and convergence modulo finite-dimensional harmonic forms

The convergence theory of the BGG system (6.3) of [QuennevilleBelair2015], §6.2 under
`Feec.BGG.HarmonicStability`: the hypotheses of [QuennevilleBelair2015], Prop 5.3 on the bottom
row, with the Hodge decomposition of `Ṽ¹` taken modulo harmonic forms ([AFW2010], §3).

## References

* [V. Quenneville-Bélair, *A New Approach to Finite Element Simulations of General Relativity*][QuennevilleBelair2015],
  Prop 5.3, §6.2
* [D. N. Arnold, R. S. Falk, R. Winther, *Finite element exterior calculus: from Hodge theory to numerical stability*][AFW2010],
  §3

Bibliography: [references.bib](../../../docs/references.bib)
-/

